// Configurations in an assembly (`configured-plate`; its Assembly is "Assembly 2"): the plate's Part Studio has a Size List
// (Thin 10 mm, Thick 20 mm); the Assembly has a Thin plate at the origin and a Thick one 80 mm
// along X, each its own configured copy of the studio.
// 01 the Assembly: a thin and a thick plate.
// 02 the Thin instance's menu ▸ Configuration ▸ Size: Thin ✓, Thick.
// 03 Thick picked: both plates are 20 mm thick (one undo step).
// 04 the Part Studio still shows Thin (the instances keep their own configuration).
// 05 Insert, the plate picked: the dialog's Configuration of Part Studio 1 shows Size: Thin.
// 06 Size ▸ Thick: the ghost under the pointer is the 20 mm plate.
// 07 a click drops it, ✓: a third plate, Thick (Part 1 <3>).
// 08 from below (the Thick plates' hole is cut 10 mm up from the bottom): Part 1 <2>'s menu ▸
//    Configuration ▸ Hole unticked: that plate's hole is gone (the Checkbox suppresses
//    Extrude 2 in its configuration), the others keep theirs.
// 09 the Bill of Materials: a row per configuration ("Thick, Hole" × 2, "Thick, No Hole" × 1),
//    named in the Configuration column added after Name with the first configured instance.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("configured-plate"),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-2")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-assembly"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Hover(ui("asm-config")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("asm-config-0")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("02-instance-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-config-0-1")),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-both-thick"),
        Click(ui("tab-part-studio-1")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-studio-thin"),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-2")),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-config-1"),
        Screenshot("05-insert-configuration"),
        Click(ui("insert-config-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-config-menu"),
        Click(ui("insert-config-row-1")),
        MoveTo(1000, 300),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("06-thick-ghost"),
        ClickAt(1000, 300),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-inserted-thick"),
        Key("Shift+6"),
        Key("F"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        Hover(ui("asm-config")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("asm-config-1-toggle")),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-no-hole"),
        Click(ui("assembly-bom")),
        WaitFor("bom-panel"),
        MoveTo(700, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-bom"),
    ],
)
